world-map.json contains 176 supplied country/region geometries (Antarctica
excluded), not 176 countries with macroeconomic data. Small territories absent
from this resolution are not added or inferred. Boundaries follow the dataset.

Generated with d3-geo 3.1.1 geoNaturalEarth1().fitExtent([[8,8],[992,512]],
featureCollection), geoPath(projection).digits(2), on a 1000 x 520 viewBox.
IDs use ISO_A2_EH where supplied, otherwise ne-ADM0_A3. Names use NAME_EN/ADMIN.
Centers are projected path centroids rounded to one decimal. No D3 runtime code
or package is included. Paths are rendered as data through React/native SVG.
The UI groups the supplied mainland and Taiwan geometries into one China path
for shared country selection and coloring; the source geometry is unmodified.
